### Create Parent Details
POST {{host}}/immuno/parent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "title": "Miss",
  "firstName": "Olubunmi",
  "lastName": "Owolabi",
  "email": "owo.ezekiel22@gmail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "08106723916"
}

### Get single parent by id
GET {{host}}/immuno/parent?id=da7f571d-6bb0-4d0f-b239-59fbc7900829
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get single parent by email
GET {{host}}/immuno/parent?email=owo.ezekiel@gmail.com
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get all parents
GET {{host}}/immuno/parents?page=0&size=20&email=ezekiel@gmail
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get all parents count
GET {{host}}/immuno/parents/count?page=0&size=20&email=ezekiel@gmail
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get single parent by phone
GET {{host}}/immuno/parent?phoneNumber=08106723911
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create Child Details For Parent
POST {{host}}/immuno/parent/4067ef60-5a42-45f9-8cd5-a0cbbcd1aa1b/child
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "gender": "MALE",
  "dateOfBirth": "2024-06-07",
  "firstName": "Tobiloba",
  "lastName": "Ezekiel"
}

### Get single child by id
GET {{host}}/immuno/child/a414d15f-264c-4c5a-a2a8-0c1ea9ed324c
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get all children
GET {{host}}/immuno/children?page=0&size=20&gender=MALE
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get all children count
GET {{host}}/immuno/children/count?page=0&size=20&email=ezekiel@gmail
Authorization: {{token}}


### Get all administered immunization count
GET {{host}}/immuno/immuno-record/count?page=0&size=20&email=ezekiel@gmail
Authorization: {{token}}
